@id n1_choirc
# DRAFT
# Brother Piers, of the choir, on the east walk at dusk (night 1), watching the rain fill the garden. Background.
== start
(A brother of the choir on the east walk, watching the rain drown the garden beds.)
Piers {amused}: They say you're from the country. You'll find London's rain is the same, only dirtier.
-> topics

== again
Piers {weary}: Still raining. It always is, in November.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n1_choirc_house] What's the house like, brother? -> house

== house [set n1_choirc_house]
Piers {sad}: Quiet. We were thirty once, the old brothers say. Now look at us.
-> end

== leave
Piers {calm}: Keep dry, porter.
